tch; it is only the missing file.\n\nNote on versions: the patcher's guard checks for `lib64/gstreamer-1.0` rather than the\nCrossOver version string, and it applies cleanly to **26.3** as well as 26.2.\n\n## Notes for UE5 / Electra titles in general\n\nSee [docs/UE5-ELECTRA-DIAGNOSIS.md](docs/UE5-ELECTRA-DIAGNOSIS.md) for the measured chain,\nthe reproducible measurement tricks, and a table of thirteen approaches that were tried and\ndo **not** work, so they do not get re-explored.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3872,"cache_read_input_tokens":555335,"output_tokens":1077,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3872,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1077,"cache_read_input_tokens":555335,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3872,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3872},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdjeCLnLPLszba5jVNjyK","type":"assistant","uuid":"9f3abe33-d3f4-4ba1-8b98-71378002c708","timestamp":"2026-08-05T12:59:29.102Z","effort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/Create/Build/Memory","sessionId":"4d7c85c8-de5a-48bd-af30-1bf0bd2b590e","version":"2.1.221","gitBranch":"main"}
